# REQUIRES: verilator
# Staged evaluation (--stage-levels N): a class whose state cone is deeper
# than N estimated levels evaluates over several host cycles, its logic cut
# by stage registers that step with the frame's positions; its state and
# inputs are read the stages before its state pass. The leaves
# (Driver/Inputs/deep) scan eight entries for the oldest, and the result
# picks a row of a RAM read combinationally (at the instance of its stage),
# the address of a RAM read through a register, an element write's entry and
# two enables; the second leaf reads a late link of Top's logic. Against the
# target (tb_late.sv), from zero state, with bubbles and stalled channels:
# one copy at N = 6 and 4, two copies with overlapped frames, a copy per
# instance, paged state (byte masks, and a dense page word whose old value
# crosses the stages), nested sequencers with a short lead, and the link
# kinds (zero-latency chains, shared, staged and compact links).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/deep
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/plain --static --bubbles Leaf > %t/plain.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PLAIN < %t/plain.log
# RUN: foldsim-opt %t/plain/foldsim_sim.mlir --pass-pipeline='builtin.module(beacon-estimate-timing{top=Leaf_static report=-})' -o /dev/null 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DEEP
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/s6 --static --bubbles --stage-levels 6 Leaf > %t/s6.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=S6 < %t/s6.log
# RUN: foldsim-opt %t/s6/foldsim_sim.mlir --pass-pipeline='builtin.module(beacon-estimate-timing{top=Leaf_static report=-})' -o /dev/null 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CUT6
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/s6/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/s6/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/s6/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/s6/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/s4 --static --bubbles --stage-levels 4 Leaf > %t/s4.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=S4 < %t/s4.log
# RUN: foldsim-opt %t/s4/foldsim_sim.mlir --pass-pipeline='builtin.module(beacon-estimate-timing{top=Leaf_static report=-})' -o /dev/null 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CUT4
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/s4/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/s4/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/s4/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/s4/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
